"template--20110899773746__320696f3-9d01-4227-b634-3e7a905720ce-column-1","template--20110899773746__320696f3-9d01-4227-b634-3e7a905720ce-column-2","template--20110899773746__320696f3-9d01-4227-b634-3e7a905720ce-column-3"],"settings":{"title":"Breathe With Intent","heading_size":"h2","text":"","icon_size":"large","columns_desktop":3,"icon_color":"accent-2","background_style":"none","color_scheme":"accent-1","columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":false,"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"1eff3883-d322-4bb7-a2ae-ecf252a06d2b":{"type":"comparison-table","blocks":{"template--20110899773746__1eff3883-d322-4bb7-a2ae-ecf252a06d2b-row-1":{"type":"row","settings":{"benefit":"Pill-free Solution","us":true,"others":false}},"template--20110899773746__1eff3883-d322-4bb7-a2ae-ecf252a06d2b-row-2":{"type":"row","settings":{"benefit":"Relieves Anxiety","us":true,"others":false}},"template--20110899773746__1eff3883-d322-4bb7-a2ae-ecf252a06d2b-row-3":{"type":"row","settings":{"benefit":"Eliminates Cravings & Withdrawals","us":true,"others":false}},"920ef122-43a1-4fb9-b63f-01c0b61fb575":{"type":"row","settings":{"benefit":"Affordable","us":true,"others":false}}},"block_order":["template--20110899773746__1eff3883-d322-4bb7-a2ae-ecf252a06d2b-row-1","template--20110899773746__1eff3883-d322-4bb7-a2ae-ecf252a06d2b-row-2","template--20110899773746__1eff3883-d322-4bb7-a2ae-ecf252a06d2b-row-3","920ef122-43a1-4fb9-b63f-01c0b61fb575"],"settings":{"title":"Choose Us Over Them","heading_size":"h2","text":"","button_label":"","link":"","button_style_secondary":false,"layout":"table_second","color_scheme":"background-1","logo_width":75,"us_label":"","others_label":"Them","benefit_color_scheme":"accent-1","checkmark_color":"#53af01","icon_cells_color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"9f842136-c588-48a5-8407-010f78185ddc":{"type":"collapsible-content","blocks":{"template--20110899773746__9f842136-c588-48a5-8407-010f78185ddc-collapsible_row-1":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Why do I need StressLess® when I can just breathe?","icon":"question_mark","row_content":"<p>StressLess® provides a physical reminder and mindful focus to engage in intentional deep breathing, enabling individuals to combat stress and anxiety more effectively.<\/p><p>Creating a sense of calmness in moments of distress, which might be challenging to achieve solely through regular breathing.<\/p>","page":""}},"template--20110899773746__9f842136-c588-48a5-8407-010f78185ddc-collapsible_row-2":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How do you clean StressLess®?","icon":"question_mark","row_content":"<ol><li>Fill a bowl or sink with warm water.<br\/><\/li><li>Add a small amount of mild dish soap to the water and mix well.<br\/><\/li><li>Place the pendant in the soapy water and let it soak for a few minutes.<br\/><\/li><li>Use a soft-bristled brush or cloth to gently scrub the pendant.<br\/><\/li><li>Rinse the pendant thoroughly with clean water to remove any soap residue.<br\/><\/li><li>Dry the pendant with a soft, lint-free cloth to prevent water spots or streaks.<\/li><\/ol>","page":""}},"template--20110899773746__9f842136-c588-48a5-8407-010f78185ddc-collapsible_row-3":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Can I wear it in the shower?","icon":"question_mark","row_content":"<p>Yes! StressLife® Necklace is durable and corrosion-resistant, so it won't rust or tarnish.<\/p>","page":""}},"template--20110899773746__9f842136-c588-48a5-8407-010f78185ddc-collapsible_row-4":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is this backed by science?","icon":"question_mark","row_content":"<p>We totally understand if you are skeptical about how or why this works because it seems so simple. StressLess® has been designed and tested by a psychotherapist who uses proven data about how breathing effects your mind.<\/p><p>Think of inhalations as the gas pedal and exhalations as the breaks. Stress triggers short inhales which sends you into \"fight or flight mode\" With over 50,000 thoughts and 150+ phone notifications daily, we enter this state of mind much too often, leaving us feeling tired and tense. <\/p><p>Extending your exhales immediately reverses this state within 1 minute by lowering cortisol (your stress hormone), blood pressure and heart rate.<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["template--20110899773746__9f842136-c588-48a5-8407-010f78185ddc-collapsible_row-1","template--20110899773746__9f842136-c588-48a5-8407-010f78185ddc-collapsible_row-2","template--20110899773746__9f842136-c588-48a5-8407-010f78185ddc-collapsible_row-3","template--20110899773746__9f842136-c588-48a5-8407-010f78185ddc-collapsible_row-4"],"settings":{"caption":"","heading":"Frequently Asked Questions","heading_size":"h2","heading_alignment":"center","layout":"none","color_scheme":"background-1","container_color_scheme":"background-2","open_first_collapsible_row":false,"image_ratio":"adapt","desktop_layout":"image_second","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"loox-product-reviews-app-section":{"type":"apps","settings":{"include_margins":false}}},"order":["main","related-products","dcf56f87-b047-4923-9012-14b5775c5e3c","999ad008-ba73-421e-aead-62595fd6d39f","46c0db62-86b2-4200-84ca-a92248451d74","320696f3-9d01-4227-b634-3e7a905720ce","1eff3883-d322-4bb7-a2ae-ecf252a06d2b","9f842136-c588-48a5-8407-010f78185ddc","loox-product-reviews-app-section"]}